{"symbol":"ARG.PA","area":"europe","updated":"2026-11-16T19:18:09Z","info":{"address1":"21, rue Beffroy","city":"Neuilly-sur-Seine","zip":"92200","country":"France","phone":"33 1 47 47 05 46","website":"https://www.argan.fr/","industry":"REIT - Industrial","industryKey":"reit-industrial","industryDisp":"REIT - Industrial","sector":"Real Estate","sectorKey":"real-estate","sectorDisp":"Real Estate","longBusinessSummary":"Argan SA is the only French real estate company specializing in the development & rental of premium warehouses. It is the leading player of its market in France. Building on a unique customer-centric approach, ARGAN develops PREMIUM and pre-let Au0nom -labelled warehouses  i.e., which produce their own energy for self-consumption  for blue-chip companies, with tailor-made services throughout all project phases from the development milestones to the rental management. As of June 30, 2026, ARGAN represented a portfolio of 3.9 million sq.m, with more than 110 warehouses located in the continental area of France. Appraised at a total of 4.3 billion euros, this portfolio generates a yearly rental income of 224 million euros (yearly rental income based on the portfolio delivered as of June 30, 2026). Profitability, well-mastered debt and sustainability are at the heart of ARGAN's DNA. The financial solidity of the Group's model is notably reflected in its investment-grade rating (BBB- with a stable outlook) with Standard & Poor's. ARGAN is also deploying a committed ESG policy addressing all its stakeholders. Argan SA is based in France.","fullTimeEmployees":28,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Jean-Claude  Le Lan","title":"Founder & Chairman of the Supervisory Board","fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":96000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Ronan  Le Lan","title":"Chairman of the Management Board","fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":300670,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Francis  Albertinelli","